# `#[options]`

<SymbolMeta />
<SymbolSignature />

OPTIONS shorthand for `#[route(OPTIONS, path, ...)]` inside an HTTP `#[handlers]` implementation.

```rust
#[options("/")]
async fn options(&self) -> StatusCode { todo!() }
```

It accepts an optional controller-relative string path followed by the shared route modifiers. `#[options]` and `#[options(streamed)]` mount at the controller base. It is a consumed marker, not a standalone function attribute. See [`#[route]`](./route) for complete grammar, modifier rules, containment, generated artifacts, and feature behavior.
